        more information on how they compare.

    .. note::
        This API does not apply to :ref:`forward-mode AD <forward-mode-ad>`.

    Example::
        >>> # xdoctest: +SKIP
        >>> x = torch.tensor([1.], requires_grad=True)
        >>> with torch.no_grad():
        ...     with torch.enable_grad():
        ...         y = x * 2
        >>> y.requires_grad
        True
        >>> y.backward()
        >>> x.grad
